## 🎯 **TODO-LISTE: Vollständiges Setup des Multi-Platform Posting-Systems**

### **Phase 1: Credentials & Testing (heute)**

#### ✅ **1. Email-Setup testen**
- [ ] **Gmail App-Password erstellen** (wenn Gmail verwendet)
- [ ] **SMTP-Credentials in n8n eintragen:**
  ```bash
  Host: smtp.gmail.com
  Port: 587
  User: deine-email@gmail.com
  Password: dein-app-password
  ```
- [ ] **EMAIL_FROM Environment Variable setzen:** `noreply@deine-domain.com`
- [ ] **Test-Email senden** mit Postman/curl:
  ```bash
  curl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/dj-event \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "eventTitle": "TEST EVENT",
    "eventDate": "2025-01-01",
    "eventTime": "20:00",
    "venue": "Test Venue",
    "city": "Test City",
    "description": "Test description",
    "emailRecipients": ["deine-email@gmail.com"],
    "publishTo": {
      "email": true,
      "twitter": false,
      "instagram": false,
      "facebook": false,
      "linkedin": false,
      "reddit": false
    }
  }'
  ```

#### ✅ **2. Twitter/X Setup**
- [ ] **Twitter Developer Account** erstellen: https://developer.twitter.com/
- [ ] **App erstellen** und API Keys bekommen
- [ ] **OAuth1 Credentials in n8n eintragen:**
  - API Key
  - API Secret  
  - Access Token
  - Access Token Secret
- [ ] **Test-Post senden** (nur Twitter aktiviert)

#### ✅ **3. Instagram Setup**
- [ ] **Meta Business Account** erstellen
- [ ] **Instagram Graph API** aktivieren
- [ ] **OAuth2 Credentials in n8n eintragen**
- [ ] **Facebook Page verknüpfen** (für Instagram Business)
- [ ] **Test-Post mit Bild senden**

#### ✅ **4. Facebook Setup**
- [ ] **Meta App erstellen** (Business Type)
- [ ] **Facebook Login** Product hinzufügen
- [ ] **Page Access Token** mit `pages_manage_posts` Permission
- [ ] **FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID** Environment Variable setzen
- [ ] **Test-Post senden**

#### ✅ **5. LinkedIn Setup**
- [ ] **LinkedIn Developer Account:** https://www.linkedin.com/developers/apps
- [ ] **OAuth2 App erstellen**
- [ ] **Redirect URL setzen:** `https://deine-n8n-url/rest/oauth2-credential/callback`
- [ ] **Permissions:** `w_member_social`, `w_organization_social`
- [ ] **Test-Post senden**

#### ✅ **6. Reddit Setup**
- [ ] **Reddit App erstellen:** https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
- [ ] **Script-Type App** wählen
- [ ] **Client ID & Secret** notieren
- [ ] **OAuth Token generieren:** https://not-an-aardvark.github.io/reddit-oauth-helper/
- [ ] **HTTP Header Auth in n8n:** `Authorization: Bearer DEIN_TOKEN`
- [ ] **REDDIT_USER_AGENT** Environment Variable setzen
- [ ] **Test-Post in Test-Subreddit senden**

### **Phase 2: Discord/Telegram Notifications**

#### 📢 **7. Discord Webhook**
